; RUN: opt -passes=loop-vectorize -prefer-inloop-reductions -S %s | FileCheck %s

; Regression test for a loop-vectorizer crash in partial-reduction chain
; construction under -prefer-inloop-reductions, where a chained reduction
; `res = sub(add(sub(res, a*b), a*c), b*c)` is identified as
; RecurKind::AddChainWithSubs but the negated mul-acc expression recipe
; previously asserted on RecurKind::Add only.

